Uno R4 Wifi
```
cd C:\Users\Jason\Downloads\arduino-cli_1.2.2_Windows_64bit
.\arduino-cli.exe compile -b arduino:renesas_uno:unor4wifi d:\Code\mycode\arduino\scratch-pad
.\arduino-cli.exe upload -t -p COM4 -b arduino:renesas_uno:unor4wifi d:\Code\mycode\arduino\scratch-pad
putty COM4 -serial -sercfg 9600,8,n,1,N
```


